    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Accepts transcript segments one-by-one as they arrive from a streaming STT source and extracts action items on-the-fly. The accumulated <ref refid="structthemis_1_1voice_1_1_meeting_protocol" kindref="compound">MeetingProtocol</ref> is available at any point via <ref refid="classthemis_1_1voice_1_1_realtime_meeting_session_1ad6db5611b7c9018a90ce4e0a1e4c9cd8" kindref="member">getCurrentProtocol()</ref>, and <ref refid="classthemis_1_1voice_1_1_realtime_meeting_session_1a5ea18b771e0977ba855a85d2f8728726" kindref="member">finalize()</ref> returns the completed protocol once the meeting has ended.</para>
<para>Thread-safety: <ref refid="classthemis_1_1voice_1_1_realtime_meeting_session_1a473b1a4fde0186d1bdcafffd439d91de" kindref="member">addSegment()</ref> and <ref refid="classthemis_1_1voice_1_1_realtime_meeting_session_1a5ea18b771e0977ba855a85d2f8728726" kindref="member">finalize()</ref> are protected by an internal mutex and may be called from separate threads (e.g. an STT callback thread). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
